## Interface: 16001
## Title: ForeverDruid
## Notes: The druid one-stop HUD for WoW Forever: mana in forms, energy ticks, combo points, role-aware cooldowns, buffs and procs, your DoTs/HoTs on target, click-to-cast reminders and Skyborne ley lines.
